AUV Practice

This educational simulator follows Twin Delayed Deep Deterministic Policy
Gradient (TD3), introduced by Scott Fujimoto, Herke van Hoof, and David Meger
in "Addressing Function Approximation Error in Actor-Critic Methods" (2018).

Algorithmic references include https://github.com/sfujim/TD3 and OpenAI
Spinning Up's TD3 documentation. The AUV simulation and browser learner were
implemented for this project.

The repository also includes unmodified reference files TD3.py, main.py,
utils.py, and LICENSE from sfujim/TD3 at revision:
34770ccdcb51df6f6c7d85c1ba7e40d71b940d16
https://github.com/sfujim/TD3/tree/34770ccdcb51df6f6c7d85c1ba7e40d71b940d16

