The walkthrough maps original Python reference excerpts to live JavaScript
execution stages. The HTML does not execute the displayed Python. This
project's AUV-specific Python excerpts are identified separately from the
sfujim/TD3 source.

The AUV papers linked in README.md motivate the learning project. This code
does not claim to reproduce their author implementations or reported results.
